  <h2>What a remapping specialist needs tracked</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A job record per remap, attached to the specific vehicle, not a general note.</li>
    <li>Booking and scheduling alongside any other work the business takes on.</li>
    <li>Invoicing raised directly from the completed job.</li>
    <li>Customer and vehicle history retained for repeat work or follow-up.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Remapping alongside other services</h2>
  <p>
    Many remapping specialists also handle general diagnostics or work alongside a wider workshop. Keeping remap
    jobs on the same board and customer record as everything else means a returning customer's full history is in
    one place, not split across a remapping-specific tool and a separate garage system.
